| Performance       | `/api/performance-reviews` | Performance reviews             |
| PIP               | `/api/pips`                | Performance improvement plans   |
| Training Programs | `/api/training-programs`   | Training management             |
| Employee Training | `/api/employee-training`   | Employee training participation |
| Interviews        | `/api/interviews`          | Recruitment interviews          |
| Candidates        | `/api/candidates`          | Candidate management            |
